- U | read the early boxes, and write both speeches before the result is known | title: member of parliament | requires: parliamentary nomination | without: approval | lacking: .04 | grants_if_fails: a long shot that missed | aims: member of parliament | v: achievement | tribal: watch which bands move first, and ready words for either end | magic: read the first urns' tallies, and write both orations before the herald speaks | chance: 50
