- R | vote against it, and say plainly why on the floor of the chamber | takes_if_fails: the party whip | mark: defied an authority | identity | v: stimulation, universalism | tribal: stand apart from the faction, and say plainly at the gathering why | magic: cast your lot against it, and say plainly why in the Assembly | chance: 74
- G | stay away from the vote, and spend the evening back home | v: tradition | tribal: stay away from the gathering's choosing, and sit at your own hearth | magic: stay away from the Assembly that day, and spend it at home | chance: 72
