- RG | hold a public meeting back home, and vote the way the meeting decides | takes_if_fails: the party whip | v: universalism, tradition | tribal: ask your own band at the fire, and stand the way it decides | magic: call a meeting in the ward, and cast your lot the way it decides | chance: 72
