== a deal to get it through
tier: life event
stages: young_adult adult mature elder
age: 18-95
holds: member of parliament | local councillor | mayor | minister
per_year: 0 0 .1 .1 .1 .1
drivers: unrest+.2 era+.1
times: per member of parliament, local councillor, mayor or minister a year: about 1 in 4 where no party holds a majority, about 1 in 20 where one does, about 1 in 10 taken together (estimate)
likelier: a hung chamber, a coalition government, a council with no overall control, a bill the member has carried for years
rarer: a large majority, a member with no bill of their own, a quiet session
gap: 1-3
domain: career.3 community.3
tone: mixed
life: work
horizon: months
roles: colleague, rival, boss, friend
earth: a hung chamber and a bill with your name on it
