- U | split the bill, and pass now the half that everyone can agree on | v: achievement | tribal: split the plan, and agree now only the part every clan accepts | magic: split the decree, and pass now the half every faction accepts | chance: 72
- B | win one member of the partner group over with a committee chair | grants: counting the votes | v: power | tribal: win over one speaker of the river clans with a place at the chief's fire | magic: win one of the Tower's members over with a seat on a council of the Crown | chance: 60
- R | take the partner group's leader out for a long dinner, and settle it as friends | mark: made a friend | v: benevolence, hedonism | tribal: share a long meal with the river clans' speaker, and settle it as friends | magic: take the Tower's spokesman to a long supper, and settle it as friends | chance: 72
- G | let the bill wait a year, until the chamber is ready for it | mark: turned down a chance | self_control: + | v: tradition | tribal: let the plan wait a year, until the clans are ready for it | magic: let the decree wait a year, until the Assembly is ready for it | chance: 56
- WUR | rewrite the bill overnight so the partner's worry is answered in the text | grants: a reform with your name on it | v: achievement, universalism | tribal: reshape the plan overnight so the river clans' fear is answered in it | magic: redraft the decree overnight so the Tower's worry is answered in its text | chance: 14
- WUG | build a group across the parties around the bill, member by member | grants: friends across the aisle; coalition building | door | v: universalism, benevolence | tribal: build a circle of speakers from every clan around the plan, one by one | magic: build a circle of members from every faction around the decree, one by one | chance: 66
